ion. The keeper returned to the lighthouse that evening, the beam sweeping across dark waters, finally lighting the path home for a lost soul.", "w02": "凌晨四点的城市沉睡在黎明前的寂静中。街灯投下苍白的光，照亮空荡荡的街道。偶有出租车呼啸而过，尾灯消失在雾气中。高楼大厦成了沉默的巨人，窗户都黑了。只有便利店还亮着，值班员困顿地打着哈欠。清洁工推着车缓缓前行，扫把声回荡在寂寥的夜色里。这是城市最孤独的时刻，也是最安静的时刻。天色渐明，晨曦初露，新的一天即将苏醒。", "w03": "• A function is like a recipe: you give it ingredients (inputs), it follows steps, and gives you a result (output).\n• Sometimes a recipe uses itself—like \"to make cake, first make the batter which needs cake crumbs\"—that's recursion!\n• Recursion stops when you reach the simplest case, like a recipe that just says \"stop here\", so it doesn't go forever."}
